1
00:00:03,990 --> 00:00:05,810
Your available balance is:

2
00:00:07,290 --> 00:00:08,310
Four dollars...

3
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:11,510
and seventy-three cents.

4
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:14,880
Nice.

5
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:30,780
Four seventy-three and the tank says E

6
00:00:31,110 --> 00:00:33,680
Payday Friday, today Tuesday

7
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,035
Coffee in the cup

8
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:36,560
Two smokes in the pack

9
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:39,495
Twenty-dollar bill that I wish I had back

10
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:42,095
Everybody online getting rich overnight

11
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:45,095
Meanwhile I'm calculating groceries under fluorescent lights

12
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:45,495
Bread

13
00:00:45,510 --> 00:00:45,940
Milk

14
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:46,460
Eggs

15
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:47,675
Put the chips back

16
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:48,775
Maybe next week

17
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:50,640
If the hydro don't attack

18
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:53,455
Funny how money disappears like smoke

19
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:54,735
One minute you're alright

20
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:56,440
Next minute you're broke

21
00:00:56,510 --> 00:00:58,080
But I still got dinner

22
00:00:58,090 --> 00:00:59,395
Still got somewhere to sleep

23
00:00:59,410 --> 00:01:00,840
And four dollars seventy-three

24
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,795
Belonging entirely to me

25
00:01:02,810 --> 00:01:05,280
Four dollars seventy-three

26
00:01:05,830 --> 00:01:06,820
Ain't much money

27
00:01:06,830 --> 00:01:08,255
But it's mine and it's free

28
00:01:08,270 --> 00:01:11,255
World keeps charging admission to breathe

29
00:01:11,270 --> 00:01:13,940
I got four dollars seventy-three

30
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:15,060
Bank sends a message:

31
00:01:15,070 --> 00:01:16,240
“Brad, we can help!”

32
00:01:16,510 --> 00:01:17,880
Yeah?

33
00:01:18,090 --> 00:01:19,080
Where were you yesterday

34
00:01:19,090 --> 00:01:20,595
When my card declined itself?

35
00:01:20,610 --> 00:01:23,180
Subscription I forgot about hit at three

36
00:01:23,290 --> 00:01:26,295
Some app I haven't opened since 2023

37
00:01:26,310 --> 00:01:26,820
Cancel.

38
00:01:26,990 --> 00:01:27,340
Cancel.

39
00:01:27,350 --> 00:01:28,120
Cancel that shit.

40
00:01:28,130 --> 00:01:30,780
Apparently adulthood's mostly passwords and bills

41
00:01:30,790 --> 00:01:31,455
Insurance

42
00:01:31,470 --> 00:01:32,115
Internet

43
00:01:32,130 --> 00:01:32,655
Phone

44
00:01:32,670 --> 00:01:33,315
Gas

45
00:01:33,330 --> 00:01:35,600
Every company got their hand in my ass

46
00:01:36,690 --> 00:01:38,220
Financially speaking.

47
00:01:39,450 --> 00:01:41,500
Four dollars seventy-three

48
00:01:42,050 --> 00:01:43,020
Ain't much money

49
00:01:43,030 --> 00:01:44,615
But it's mine and it's free

50
00:01:44,630 --> 00:01:47,415
World keeps charging admission to breathe

51
00:01:47,430 --> 00:01:50,140
I got four dollars seventy-three

52
00:02:14,690 --> 00:02:17,100
Then my kid laughs from the other room

53
00:02:17,170 --> 00:02:19,875
Dog starts barking at the fucking moon

54
00:02:19,890 --> 00:02:20,975
Dinner smells good

55
00:02:20,990 --> 00:02:22,900
Someone I love says my name

56
00:02:23,110 --> 00:02:25,620
Suddenly broke doesn't feel quite the same

57
00:02:25,630 --> 00:02:28,420
Maybe wealth ain't numbers sitting inside an app

58
00:02:28,430 --> 00:02:31,400
Maybe sometimes it's knowing exactly what you have

59
00:02:31,410 --> 00:02:31,860
Still—

60
00:02:31,910 --> 00:02:32,875
I'd like some money.

61
00:02:32,890 --> 00:02:34,340
Let's not get philosophical.

62
00:02:34,350 --> 00:02:37,080
Four seventy-three is objectively terrible.

63
00:02:37,090 --> 00:02:38,635
But tomorrow I'll work

64
00:02:38,650 --> 00:02:40,220
Friday gets paid

65
00:02:40,250 --> 00:02:41,715
Some goes forward

66
00:02:41,730 --> 00:02:43,000
Some gets saved

67
00:02:43,010 --> 00:02:45,220
Some disappears before I blink

68
00:02:45,290 --> 00:02:46,620
And I'll probably buy coffee

69
00:02:46,630 --> 00:02:48,900
Because I refuse instant drink

70
00:02:51,290 --> 00:02:53,695
Four dollars seventy-three

71
00:02:53,710 --> 00:02:54,620
Not my future

72
00:02:54,630 --> 00:02:56,555
Just tonight's reality

73
00:02:56,570 --> 00:02:59,675
World keeps charging admission to breathe

74
00:02:59,690 --> 00:03:02,300
Tonight I'm worth more

75
00:03:02,310 --> 00:03:04,400
Than four seventy-three.

76
00:03:13,750 --> 00:03:15,120
LOW BALANCE ALERT.

77
00:03:18,490 --> 00:03:19,640
Yeah.

78
00:03:19,710 --> 00:03:21,160
I know.
